{"type":"new","contents":"import InfoGeometry.Canonical.DrazinModularPersistence\nimport InfoGeometry.Meta.Architecture\n\n/-!\n# Horizon zitter modes\n\nMatter as modular-chiral trembling around a Drazin horizon.\n\nThis file extends `DrazinModularPersistence` without duplicating its owner API.\nThe existing file owns:\n\n* modular zero modes,\n* Drazin support horizons,\n* physical horizons,\n\nThis file adds the theorem-safe zitter socket:\n\n* a discrete involutive symmetry for chiral/CPT/V₄-style trembling;\n* a structural Klein-four-style action socket;\n* a Drazin frequency projector `1 - L * Lᴰ` for harmonic envelopes;\n* a horizon zitter mode whose raw observable may move, while its envelope is\n  explicitly extracted by double-sided harmonic compression of the\n  Drazin-compressed raw observable and certified horizon-localized, harmonic,\n  and modular-zero;\nNo claim is made that a raw modular-chiral orbit is itself physical.  Optional\nFierz/channel readouts are isolated in `HorizonZitterFierzReadout`.\n-/\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nnamespace InfoGeometry.Canonical.HorizonZitterModes\n\nopen InfoGeometry.Canonical.DrazinModularPersistence\nopen InfoGeometry.Canonical.Drazin\nopen InfoGeometry.OperatorAlgebra.Thermodynamics\n\n/-- Drazin horizon data reuses the persistence support owner. -/\nabbrev DrazinHorizon\n    (Obs : Type*) [Ring Obs] [Star Obs] :=\n  DrazinSupportData Obs\n\n/--\nA discrete involutive multiplicative symmetry.\n\nThis is an abstract socket for chirality, CPT, or a generator of a Klein-four\nsymmetry.  The file does not assume such a symmetry exists canonically.\n-/\n@[rep_depth operator]\nstructure InvolutiveSymmetry\n    (Obs : Type*) [Ring Obs] where\n  action : Obs ≃+* Obs\n  involutive : ∀ x : Obs, action (action x) = x\n\n/--\nA Klein-four-style action by ring automorphisms.\n\nThis is intentionally structural.  It records an abstract fourfold discrete\nsymmetry action without choosing a concrete finite type or proving that the\ntype has exactly four elements.\n-/\n@[rep_depth operator]\nstructure KleinFourAction\n    (Obs : Type*) [Ring Obs] where\n  V4 : Type*\n  one : V4\n  mul : V4 → V4 → V4\n  action : V4 → Obs ≃+* Obs\n  action_one : action one = RingEquiv.refl Obs\n  action_mul :\n    ∀ g h : V4, ∀ x : Obs,\n      action (mul g h) x = action g (action h x)\n  involutive :\n    ∀ g : V4, ∀ x : Obs,\n      action g (action g x) = x\n\n/--\nThe modular-chiral trembling orbit generated by modular time and one supplied\ninvolutive symmetry.\n-/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ndef modularChiralOrbit\n    {Obs : Type*} [Ring Obs]\n    (flow : ModularFlow Obs)\n    (χ : InvolutiveSymmetry Obs)\n    (x : Obs)\n    (t : ℝ) : Obs :=\n  flow.flow t (χ.action x)\n\n/--\nA modular V₄ orbit point.\n\nThis is the structural form of `x(t,g) = σ_t(g · x)`.\n-/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ndef modularV4Orbit\n    {Obs : Type*} [Ring Obs]\n    (flow : ModularFlow Obs)\n    (V : KleinFourAction Obs)\n    (x : Obs)\n    (g : V.V4)\n    (t : ℝ) : Obs :=\n  flow.flow t (V.action g x)\n\n/--\nDrazin data for a modular-chiral frequency operator.\n\nThis is distinct from the signal Drazin support.  Here the projector\n`1 - L * LD` is the harmonic / zero-frequency selector.\n-/\n@[rep_depth operator]\nstructure DrazinFrequencyData\n    (Obs : Type*) [Ring Obs] [Star Obs] where\n  L : Obs\n  LD : Obs\n  harmonicProj : Obs\n  index : ℕ\n  drazin_law : IsDrazinInverse L LD index\n  harmonicProj_def : harmonicProj = 1 - L * LD\n  harmonic_self_adjoint : star harmonicProj = harmonicProj\n\nnamespace DrazinFrequencyData\n\nvariable {Obs : Type*} [Ring Obs] [Star Obs]\nvariable (F : DrazinFrequencyData Obs)\n\n/-- The harmonic / zero-frequency projector is idempotent. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem harmonic_idempotent :\n    F.harmonicProj * F.harmonicProj = F.harmonicProj := by\n  rw [F.harmonicProj_def]\n  simpa [IsDrazinInverse.complementaryProjection, IsDrazinInverse.projection] using\n    IsDrazinInverse.complementaryProjection_is_idempotent F.drazin_law\n\nend DrazinFrequencyData\n\n/--\nA horizon harmonic mode is localized on the Drazin horizon, selected by the\nfrequency harmonic projector on both sides, and fixed by the modular flow.\n-/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ndef IsHorizonHarmonicMode\n    {Obs : Type*} [Ring Obs] [Star Obs]\n    (flow : ModularFlow Obs)\n    (H : DrazinHorizon Obs)\n    (F : DrazinFrequencyData Obs)\n    (x : Obs) : Prop :=\n  H.p * x * H.p = x ∧\n  F.harmonicProj * x * F.harmonicProj = x ∧\n  IsModularZeroMode flow x\n\n/--\nEnvelope extraction formula.\n\nThe raw observable may tremble under modular-chiral transport.  The physical\nenvelope is required to be the double-sided harmonic projection of the\nDrazin-compressed raw observable:\n\n`envelope = P_harm * (p * raw * p) * P_harm`.\n\nThis is a definition-level link between the raw orbit and the certified\nenvelope; it is not a proof that arbitrary raw observables have such envelopes.\n-/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ndef HorizonEnvelopeFormula\n    {Obs : Type*} [Ring Obs]\n    (p : Obs)\n    (P_harm : Obs)\n    (raw envelope : Obs) : Prop :=\n  envelope = P_harm * (p * raw * p) * P_harm\n\n/--\nA horizon zitter mode.\n\nThe raw observable is allowed to tremble under modular-chiral flow.  The\nphysical readout is its supplied envelope, explicitly extracted as the harmonic\ndouble compression of the Drazin-compressed raw observable and certified as a\nharmonic zero mode localized on the Drazin horizon.\n-/\n@[rep_depth operator]\nstructure HorizonZitterMode\n    (Obs : Type*) [Ring Obs] [Star Obs] where\n  flow : ModularFlow Obs\n  horizon : DrazinHorizon Obs\n  frequency : DrazinFrequencyData Obs\n  chirality : InvolutiveSymmetry Obs\n  raw : Obs\n  envelope : Obs\n  horizon_fixed : IsPhysicalHorizon flow horizon\n  envelope_formula :\n    HorizonEnvelopeFormula\n      horizon.p\n      frequency.harmonicProj\n      raw\n      envelope\n  envelope_is_harmonic :\n    IsHorizonHarmonicMode flow horizon frequency envelope\n\n/--\nA horizon zitter mode with an explicit V₄-style symmetry action.\n\nThe same safety boundary applies: the raw observable may move around the\ndiscrete-modular orbit, while the supplied envelope is explicitly extracted\nby double-sided harmonic compression from the Drazin-compressed raw observable\nand certified as the physical harmonic zero mode on the Drazin horizon.\n-/\n@[rep_depth operator]\nstructure HorizonV4ZitterMode\n    (Obs : Type*) [Ring Obs] [Star Obs] where\n  flow : ModularFlow Obs\n  horizon : DrazinHorizon Obs\n  frequency : DrazinFrequencyData Obs\n  V4 : KleinFourAction Obs\n  raw : Obs\n  envelope : Obs\n  horizon_fixed : IsPhysicalHorizon flow horizon\n  envelope_formula :\n    HorizonEnvelopeFormula\n      horizon.p\n      frequency.harmonicProj\n      raw\n      envelope\n  envelope_is_harmonic :\n    IsHorizonHarmonicMode flow horizon frequency envelope\n\nnamespace HorizonZitterMode\n\nvariable {Obs : Type*}\nvariable [Ring Obs] [Star Obs]\nvariable (Z : HorizonZitterMode Obs)\n\n/-- The raw modular-chiral trembling orbit attached to a horizon zitter mode. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ndef orbit (t : ℝ) : Obs :=\n  modularChiralOrbit Z.flow Z.chirality Z.raw t\n\n/-- Certificate readout: the envelope is localized on the Drazin horizon. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem envelope_horizon_localized :\n    Z.horizon.p * Z.envelope * Z.horizon.p = Z.envelope :=\n  Z.envelope_is_harmonic.1\n\n/-- Certificate readout: the envelope is selected by the frequency harmonic projector. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem envelope_harmonic_projected :\n    Z.frequency.harmonicProj * Z.envelope * Z.frequency.harmonicProj = Z.envelope :=\n  Z.envelope_is_harmonic.2.1\n\n/-- Certificate readout: the envelope is a modular zero mode. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem envelope_modular_zero :\n    IsModularZeroMode Z.flow Z.envelope :=\n  Z.envelope_is_harmonic.2.2\n\n/-- Certificate readout: the Drazin horizon of a horizon zitter mode is modularly fixed. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem horizon_is_physical :\n    IsPhysicalHorizon Z.flow Z.horizon :=\n  Z.horizon_fixed\n\n/-- Certificate readout: the envelope is linked to the raw trembling observable. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem envelope_extraction_formula :\n    HorizonEnvelopeFormula\n      Z.horizon.p\n      Z.frequency.harmonicProj\n      Z.raw\n      Z.envelope :=\n  Z.envelope_formula\n\nend HorizonZitterMode\n\nnamespace HorizonV4ZitterMode\n\nvariable {Obs : Type*}\nvariable [Ring Obs] [Star Obs]\nvariable (Z : HorizonV4ZitterMode Obs)\n\n/-- The raw modular-V₄ trembling orbit attached to a horizon V₄ zitter mode. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ndef orbit (g : Z.V4.V4) (t : ℝ) : Obs :=\n  modularV4Orbit Z.flow Z.V4 Z.raw g t\n\n/-- Certificate readout: the envelope is localized on the Drazin horizon. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem envelope_horizon_localized :\n    Z.horizon.p * Z.envelope * Z.horizon.p = Z.envelope :=\n  Z.envelope_is_harmonic.1\n\n/-- Certificate readout: the envelope is selected by the frequency harmonic projector. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem envelope_harmonic_projected :\n    Z.frequency.harmonicProj * Z.envelope * Z.frequency.harmonicProj = Z.envelope :=\n  Z.envelope_is_harmonic.2.1\n\n/-- Certificate readout: the envelope is a modular zero mode. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem envelope_modular_zero :\n    IsModularZeroMode Z.flow Z.envelope :=\n  Z.envelope_is_harmonic.2.2\n\n/-- Certificate readout: the Drazin horizon of a horizon V₄ zitter mode is modularly fixed. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem horizon_is_physical :\n    IsPhysicalHorizon Z.flow Z.horizon :=\n  Z.horizon_fixed\n\n/-- Certificate readout: the envelope is linked to the raw V₄ trembling observable. -/\n@[rep_depth operator]\ntheorem envelope_extraction_formula :\n    HorizonEnvelopeFormula\n      Z.horizon.p\n      Z.frequency.harmonicProj\n      Z.raw\n      Z.envelope :=\n  Z.envelope_formula\n\nend HorizonV4ZitterMode\n\n/--\nThe apex algebra of the chiral causal cone, represented theorem-safely as a\npredicate on observables.\n\nThe intended readback is the joint sector that is Drazin-supported, modular\nzero-frequency, chiral/CPT balanced, and harmonic.\n-/\n@[rep_depth operator]\nstructure ChiralCausalApex\n    (Obs : Type*) [Ring Obs] [Star Obs] where\n  flow : ModularFlow Obs\n  horizon : DrazinHorizon Obs\n  frequency : DrazinFrequencyData Obs\n  chirality : InvolutiveSymmetry Obs\n  Apex : Obs → Prop\n  apex_supported :\n    ∀ x : Obs, Apex x → horizon.p * x * horizon.p = x\n  apex_modular_zero :\n    ∀ x : Obs, Apex x → IsModularZeroMode flow x\n  apex_harmonic :\n    ∀ x : Obs, Apex x → frequency.harmonicProj * x * frequency.harmonicProj = x\n  apex_chiral_balanced :\n    ∀ x : Obs, Apex x → chirality.action x = x\n\nend InfoGeometry.Canonical.HorizonZitterModes\n","mtime":1778778565863}